WEBVTT

00:00:02.043 --> 00:00:06.296
Vegeta had dispatched Nappa himself.

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:13.887
In the face of such incomparable power,

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:17.224
Goku finally risks using a technique

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:20.894
that will push him beyond his limits.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:25.399
May my body withstand this!
Times-three Kaio-ken!!

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.904
Dokkan Dokkan tsuite'ru

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:34.074
Dokkan Dokkan paradise

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:38.203
Genki dama ga hajiketobu ze

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:41.623
Go Go Let's do it

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:48.630
Ugomeku ayashii enajii

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:54.595
yousha wa shinai ze mite'ro yo

00:00:54.679 --> 00:01:00.559
Inochi ni kaete mo mamoru yo

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:06.732
Ai suru yuuki wo tsuyosa ni kaero

00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:12.738
Yarinuku kiai de pinchi wo koete'ku

00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:19.995
Tegowai yatsu hodo wakuwaku mo dekkai ze

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:24.208
Dokkan Dokkan tsuite'ru

00:01:24.292 --> 00:01:27.503
Dokkan Dokkan chansu sa

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:33.133
Rakkii no kaze ni byunbyun notte

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:36.095
Dokkan Dokkan tsuite'ru

00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:39.348
Dokkan Dokkan ashita mo

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:46.480
kotae wo mou tamashii wa shitte'ru no sa

00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:50.192
Dragon Soul!

00:01:52.862 --> 00:01:59.535
"The Impact of the Kamehame-Ha!
Vegeta's Tenacious Transformation."

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:57.968
Times-three Kaio-ken!!

00:03:05.977 --> 00:03:08.312
Awesome, man...

00:03:25.455 --> 00:03:28.373
Why, you...!

00:03:50.772 --> 00:03:53.899
Y-You miserable...!

00:03:59.614 --> 00:04:04.368
H-He's got 'im! He just might win this!

00:05:00.341 --> 00:05:03.051
I-Impossible! How can his...

00:05:03.136 --> 00:05:07.764
How can Kakarrot's battle
power be greater than mine?

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:19.359
D-D-Damn, this guy is tough.
I have to settle this quick, or else...

00:05:21.612 --> 00:05:24.614
S-Shoot, my body...

00:05:24.699 --> 00:05:27.826
I-I'm not going to let this happen!

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.953
I am a super-elite!

00:05:30.038 --> 00:05:35.292
There's no way I'll be beaten
by that lower-class warrior!

00:05:35.376 --> 00:05:39.671
I am the best in the universe!

00:05:39.756 --> 00:05:44.634
S-Sure enough, it looks like using a
triple Kaio-ken is too much for me.

00:05:44.719 --> 00:05:49.348
If this drags out too long,
I'm the one who will be done in first.

00:05:53.936 --> 00:05:55.228
Blood!

00:05:55.313 --> 00:05:59.775
My noble blood has been
spilled by that piece of trash?!

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:08.325
I-I won't allow it! No way... No way will I allow it!

00:06:08.409 --> 00:06:11.036
Who needs this planet anymore?!

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:16.083
I'm going to blow you and
all of Earth into tiny pieces!

00:06:17.752 --> 00:06:19.836
You're gonna what?!

00:06:23.299 --> 00:06:25.967
Go ahead and dodge this if you can!

00:06:26.052 --> 00:06:30.055
You might save yourself,
but Earth will be blown to pieces!

00:06:30.139 --> 00:06:32.682
Damn, he thought this through!

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:37.854
I'll have to risk it!

00:06:44.404 --> 00:06:50.117
A triple-Kaio-ken...

00:06:50.201 --> 00:06:53.745
...Kamehame-ha!

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:59.626
Ka... me...

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:02.003
...ha...

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:05.590
There's no way you can stop my Gyallic-Ho!

00:07:05.675 --> 00:07:09.302
...me...

00:07:10.721 --> 00:07:15.600
I'll turn you and the whole Earth into space dust!

00:07:15.685 --> 00:07:21.022
...ha!!

00:07:28.698 --> 00:07:33.076
W-What?! It's just like my Gyallic-Ho!

00:07:44.714 --> 00:07:47.048
Kaio-ken...

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:50.969
...times four!

00:07:58.144 --> 00:08:00.729
I-It's pushing me back--

00:08:23.336 --> 00:08:28.965
H-H-He did it! He did it!

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:34.346
Son! Ya did it, you magnificent bastard!

00:08:35.806 --> 00:08:38.517
Yajirobe? What are you doing here?

00:08:38.601 --> 00:08:41.228
What, you didn't notice?

00:08:41.312 --> 00:08:45.232
For as strong as even you are,
you sure did bust yer tail there, huh?

00:08:45.316 --> 00:08:50.111
--Yeah, I guess.
--But then, way to send that awesome dude flyin'!

00:08:50.196 --> 00:08:53.406
You sure are one helluva stud, there.

00:08:58.162 --> 00:09:00.288
W-What? What'sa matter?

00:09:00.373 --> 00:09:03.750
I-I used a technique that was
too much for my body to take.

00:09:03.834 --> 00:09:06.878
Oh, yeah? Well, it wasn't
nothin' normal, that's fer sure.

00:09:06.963 --> 00:09:11.341
Never mind me, Yajirobe,
you should get out of here.

00:09:11.425 --> 00:09:12.801
What for?

00:09:12.885 --> 00:09:14.386
Y-You don't mean...

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:20.058
He's still alive. If that's all it
took to kill him, it'd be too easy.

00:09:20.142 --> 00:09:25.063
B-But it's no sweat, right?
You're the stronger one.

00:09:25.147 --> 00:09:28.733
I told you, I overdid it,
and now my body is falling apart.

00:09:28.818 --> 00:09:31.152
I might be just about maxed out.

00:09:31.237 --> 00:09:33.363
I-Is that right?

00:09:35.449 --> 00:09:37.117
Well, then...

00:09:37.201 --> 00:09:39.744
G-Good luck with that!

00:09:52.174 --> 00:09:56.761
D-Damn it!

00:09:56.846 --> 00:10:02.100
How?! How can Kakarrot's battle
power be greater than mine?!

00:10:02.184 --> 00:10:05.145
Damn it all! I am a Saiyan!

00:10:05.229 --> 00:10:08.898
I am the strongest one in the entire world!

00:10:13.821 --> 00:10:15.905
At this point, as much as I hate how ugly it is,

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:17.532
it's time for my last resort--

00:10:17.617 --> 00:10:21.453
to transform into a Great Ape, and crush him!

00:10:21.537 --> 00:10:25.665
My strength as a Great Ape is overwhelming!

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.543
Damn it, I chose to arrive here
on the day of the full moon

00:10:28.628 --> 00:10:31.796
so that we could wipe out the
people of this planet quickly,

00:10:31.881 --> 00:10:35.592
but I never thought I'd have to
transform just to defeat Kakarrot!

00:10:35.676 --> 00:10:38.094
This really burns me up!

00:10:42.224 --> 00:10:47.937
That's strange. It's well past time
that the moon should be visible.

00:10:48.022 --> 00:10:50.982
Saiyan, no matter how hard
you look, it won't do any good.

00:10:51.067 --> 00:10:52.442
The moon isn't there.

00:10:52.526 --> 00:10:55.779
That Piccolo fellow was afraid
something like this might happen,

00:10:55.863 --> 00:10:57.739
and got rid of it long ago.

00:10:57.823 --> 00:11:02.410
Still, Goku can't have very much strength left.

00:11:02.495 --> 00:11:05.372
Even if the Saiyan doesn't
transform into a Great Ape,

00:11:05.456 --> 00:11:07.624
it doesn't change the fact that he's in trouble.

00:11:07.708 --> 00:11:09.876
But then, he's growing weaker, too.

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:13.338
The Genki Dama! If you can
hit him with a Genki Dama,

00:11:13.422 --> 00:11:16.341
you'll beat him for sure!

00:11:20.971 --> 00:11:24.432
That's weird. He's just hovering around up there.

00:11:24.517 --> 00:11:26.559
Why doesn't he come down after me?

00:11:26.644 --> 00:11:30.188
It's gone! It's gone! It's gone! Damn it!

00:11:30.272 --> 00:11:33.692
The moon isn't anywhere! How can this be?!

00:11:33.776 --> 00:11:38.321
I get it. Damn it! That bastard
is driving me right up the wall!

00:11:38.406 --> 00:11:41.574
Kakarrot took out the moon
before we even got started!

00:11:41.659 --> 00:11:42.826
Now I've got no choice.

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.744
My battle power might drop a little bit,

00:11:44.829 --> 00:11:47.330
but it doesn't look like I've got any other option.

00:11:47.415 --> 00:11:51.835
Ha, I can't wait to see the
look of panic on his face!

00:12:08.477 --> 00:12:11.020
He's finally coming back down.

00:12:15.443 --> 00:12:18.528
The only way for me to beat
him is with a Genki Dama.

00:12:18.612 --> 00:12:21.531
Will I be able to focus enough?

00:12:21.615 --> 00:12:23.575
Kakarrot!

00:12:23.659 --> 00:12:26.536
You may have thought you were
clever, getting rid of the moon,

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.246
but it's not going to work!

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:31.750
The moon? What do you mean?

00:12:31.834 --> 00:12:33.877
And now you're playing dumb.

00:12:33.961 --> 00:12:36.463
Do you know why it is that
we are able to transform

00:12:36.547 --> 00:12:38.465
when we look at a full moon?

00:12:38.549 --> 00:12:39.966
Transform?

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:43.678
The light of the moon is that
which is reflected from the sun.

00:12:43.763 --> 00:12:46.556
It is only when sunlight is
bounced back by the moon

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:48.266
that it contains Bruits waves.

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:50.560
When the moon is full,

00:12:50.644 --> 00:12:54.397
those Bruits waves exceed
a value of 1 7 million zenoes.

00:12:54.482 --> 00:12:56.941
What is this guy talking about?

00:12:57.026 --> 00:13:01.404
Once at least 1 7 million zenoes of
Bruits waves are absorbed by the eyes,

00:13:01.489 --> 00:13:03.907
the tail responds to it...

00:13:03.991 --> 00:13:06.034
...and the transformation begins!

00:13:06.118 --> 00:13:07.827
There are a limited number of Saiyans

00:13:07.912 --> 00:13:09.579
that can artificially create a full moon

00:13:09.663 --> 00:13:12.207
that produces more than 1 7 million zenoes.

00:13:12.291 --> 00:13:15.794
Your gambit won't play out!
Despite getting rid of the moon,

00:13:15.878 --> 00:13:20.590
when the oxygen of this planet
mixes with my Power Ball...

00:13:26.514 --> 00:13:28.223
Sorry to keep you waiting, Kakarrot.

00:13:28.307 --> 00:13:30.975
Your death is finally at hand!

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:34.020
A lower-class warrior shouldn't have challenged

00:13:34.104 --> 00:13:36.856
a super-elite like me to battle, anyhow!

00:13:36.941 --> 00:13:40.819
The moment he produced that
strange light, his Ki dropped.

00:13:40.903 --> 00:13:44.280
What is he planning to do,
that he would go that far?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.581
What?!

00:14:01.966 --> 00:14:04.384
Burst open and intermix!

00:14:17.648 --> 00:14:20.275
W-What...

00:14:20.359 --> 00:14:23.152
...is that? What have you done?!

00:14:25.573 --> 00:14:28.366
Y-You don't mean...

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:32.370
H-He created a moon!

00:14:37.459 --> 00:14:43.590
You're going to regret having
lost your tail, Kakarrot!

00:15:01.775 --> 00:15:04.319
'Ulp!

00:15:04.403 --> 00:15:06.571
Is this the end?

00:15:15.664 --> 00:15:17.874
W-What is that?

00:15:45.444 --> 00:15:48.947
H-Hey, over there...

00:15:51.408 --> 00:15:54.702
T-That's the direction we just came from.

00:15:54.787 --> 00:15:58.039
What could it be? It's awfully bright.

00:16:02.503 --> 00:16:05.004
T-This is impossible!

00:16:21.939 --> 00:16:24.774
W-What is that? There's a tremendous Ki rising.

00:16:24.858 --> 00:16:28.778
Father's Ki hasn't gone up again, has it?

00:16:28.862 --> 00:16:32.615
N-No, this icky feeling is from the other guy.

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:36.452
And I have to say, his Ki is really something else.

00:16:36.537 --> 00:16:38.746
What's going on?

00:16:38.831 --> 00:16:41.416
F-Father...

00:16:46.255 --> 00:16:47.880
Gohan...

00:16:50.426 --> 00:16:54.429
I-I'm going back there.

00:16:54.513 --> 00:16:57.056
I'm going back.

00:16:57.141 --> 00:17:00.226
G-Going back? You mean, to where Goku is?

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:04.480
I-I just know that Father is in danger,

00:17:04.565 --> 00:17:07.483
and he's going to die if I don't do something.

00:17:07.568 --> 00:17:10.319
What are you talking about, Gohan? Goku isn't--

00:17:10.404 --> 00:17:13.614
There's no way your father
is going to die, you know.

00:17:13.699 --> 00:17:16.576
For one thing, even if we do go back,

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:18.161
against a guy with a Ki like that...

00:17:18.245 --> 00:17:21.456
Yes, I know...

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.291
Still...

00:17:23.375 --> 00:17:27.170
I have to go! I'm sure of it!

00:17:27.254 --> 00:17:29.213
H-Hey!

00:17:29.298 --> 00:17:31.340
Wait up, Gohan!

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:50.610
What do you say, Kakarrot?

00:17:50.694 --> 00:17:53.821
You're finished now!

00:17:57.284 --> 00:17:59.786
W-What is going on here?!

00:18:12.132 --> 00:18:16.052
A-A Great Ape? A Great Ape monster?!

00:18:21.725 --> 00:18:24.143
I'm going to let you in on a little something.

00:18:24.228 --> 00:18:26.729
The battle power of a Saiyan
in his Great Ape form

00:18:26.814 --> 00:18:30.733
is ten times greater than before!

00:18:34.738 --> 00:18:37.073
Goku, on the night of the full moon,

00:18:37.157 --> 00:18:41.661
a giant ape monster appears.
You must not go outside then.

00:18:41.745 --> 00:18:44.914
If you're asleep, you'll be safe.

00:18:44.998 --> 00:18:49.544
I will fix it so that your tail never grows back.

00:18:49.628 --> 00:18:52.672
It seems to be something of a nuisance, after all.

00:18:52.756 --> 00:18:57.468
So that's it. I finally understand.

00:18:57.553 --> 00:18:59.637
H-How can that be?

00:18:59.721 --> 00:19:02.890
The monster that stomped Grandpa to death...

00:19:02.975 --> 00:19:08.187
...and appeared at the tournament
grounds, smashing them up...

00:19:08.272 --> 00:19:11.691
...w-was me?

00:19:17.447 --> 00:19:19.157
Forgive me, Grandpa.

00:19:19.241 --> 00:19:21.534
This guy is ridiculously powerful.

00:19:21.618 --> 00:19:26.581
Unless I use up all of my Ki, I doubt
I have a chance of beating him.

00:19:26.665 --> 00:19:29.667
Once I die, and go back over to the Next World,

00:19:29.751 --> 00:19:31.586
I'll come and apologize to you.

00:19:36.049 --> 00:19:38.092
I'll show you, Vegeta!

00:19:38.177 --> 00:19:40.845
I'm gonna cram a Genki Dama
from me and the Earth

00:19:40.929 --> 00:19:43.848
right down your throat!

00:19:49.521 --> 00:19:51.939
F-Father!

00:19:53.692 --> 00:19:57.862
Goku... He's your son, all right.

00:20:24.681 --> 00:20:27.975
K-Kaio-ken!

00:20:36.985 --> 00:20:38.945
What's the matter?!

00:20:41.657 --> 00:20:45.910
Can't you even run away?

00:20:45.994 --> 00:20:49.121
Die!

00:20:53.252 --> 00:20:57.922
What's the matter, Kakarrot?
Can't you deal with this?

00:20:58.006 --> 00:21:01.425
A-As huge as he is, he's so fast!

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:05.805
There ain't enough time for me
to focus to create a Genki Dama!

00:21:05.889 --> 00:21:09.767
Not even a times-five Kaio-ken
would work against him!

00:21:09.851 --> 00:21:12.270
Hmph, you're not going to come at me?

00:21:12.354 --> 00:21:15.773
In that case, I'll go after you!

00:21:15.857 --> 00:21:17.984
The situation is critical!

00:21:18.068 --> 00:21:20.736
While facing Vegeta, turned into a Great Ape,

00:21:20.821 --> 00:21:24.991
will you be able to create a Genki Dama, Goku?

00:21:25.075 --> 00:21:30.663
Rats, I only need ten seconds!
Give me enough time to focus!

00:21:31.915 --> 00:21:34.834
Yaburekabure omoikiri

00:21:34.918 --> 00:21:39.422
Tobu n da mugen no sora e

00:21:39.506 --> 00:21:42.341
Jetto kiryuu ni nokkari

00:21:42.426 --> 00:21:45.469
doko demo iku yo sokkou

00:21:45.554 --> 00:21:47.805
Mukoumizu tte saikou

00:21:47.889 --> 00:21:51.225
Let's go tip-top!All right?

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:57.106
Me mo sameru you na aoi chikyuu

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:03.279
kakegaenai kono hoshi yuzurenai kara

00:22:04.656 --> 00:22:07.616
Hajiketobase kamehameha

00:22:07.701 --> 00:22:10.870
Yabame no kono jidai

00:22:10.954 --> 00:22:16.584
sekai wo mamoru tame umareta kara

00:22:16.668 --> 00:22:19.587
Yaburekabure omoikiri

00:22:19.671 --> 00:22:22.798
Yaru n da furupawaa

00:22:22.883 --> 00:22:26.844
Kibou ga ore no buki dakara

00:22:26.928 --> 00:22:30.181
mirai shinjite

00:22:34.478 --> 00:22:36.103
Heya! I'm Goku!

00:22:36.188 --> 00:22:39.190
I've gathered the genki energy
from all the Earth, but damn it,

00:22:39.274 --> 00:22:41.859
Vegeta's attack was too fast,
and the Genki Dama...

00:22:41.943 --> 00:22:44.153
I don't know what you want
to do, but it won't work.

00:22:44.237 --> 00:22:46.530
I'll crush you with my own two hands!

00:22:46.615 --> 00:22:48.908
Stop! Let my father go!

00:22:48.992 --> 00:22:51.786
What? Go after my tail, will you?

00:22:51.870 --> 00:22:53.746
Next time on Dragon Ball Z Kai,

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:57.333
"Goku on the Ropes! Pin Your
Wishes on the Genki Dama."

00:22:57.417 --> 00:22:59.835
I'm going to defeat you!
